    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": "https://www.gavalier.sk/ai-agenti/#faq",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "\u010co je AI agent?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Program, ktor\u00fd vykon\u00e1 \u00falohu s viacer\u00fdmi krokmi: pre\u010d\u00edta \u00fadaje, rozhodne sa pod\u013ea zadania a sprav\u00ed \u010fal\u0161\u00ed krok, napr\u00edklad priprav\u00ed podklad alebo zarad\u00ed spr\u00e1vu. Na rozdiel od oby\u010dajn\u00e9ho skriptu zvl\u00e1da aj \u00falohy, kde pravidl\u00e1 nie s\u00fa \u010disto mechanick\u00e9."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Kedy sta\u010d\u00ed oby\u010dajn\u00e1 automatiz\u00e1cia a kedy treba AI agenta?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Ak sa postup d\u00e1 zap\u00edsa\u0165 do pevn\u00fdch pravidiel, sta\u010d\u00ed automatiz\u00e1cia. AI agent sa hod\u00ed, ke\u010f treba pracova\u0165 s textom a \u00fasudkom. Pri prvom hovore v\u00e1m poviem, \u010do sa hod\u00ed vo va\u0161om pr\u00edpade."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "M\u00f4\u017ee AI agent urobi\u0165 chybu?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "\u00c1no, AI rob\u00ed aj chyby. Pri agentoch preto navrhujem kontrolu v\u00fdstupov \u010dlovekom tam, kde by chyba st\u00e1la peniaze."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "\u010co je dashboard a na\u010do mi je?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Dashboard je jeden preh\u013ead \u00fadajov z viacer\u00fdch syst\u00e9mov. V\u010faka nemu na jednom mieste uvid\u00edte, kde proces \u0161kr\u00edpe, a \u010dasto sa tak n\u00e1jdu \u00faspory."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Ko\u013eko AI agent stoj\u00ed?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Z\u00e1kazky beriem od p\u00e1r desiatok eur po tis\u00edce, pod\u013ea toho, \u010do treba spravi\u0165. Cenu poviem dopredu a plat\u00ed, dodato\u010dn\u00e9 hodiny pri natiahnutej pr\u00e1ci ne\u00fa\u010dtujem."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "\u010co ak mi v\u00fdsledok nebude sedie\u0165?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Plat\u00edte len za v\u00fdsledok. Ak dodan\u00e9 nesed\u00ed s dohodou, peniaze nep\u00fdtam."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
